Error result

When the operation fails, the audit log entry looks the same except for the result value.

```yaml
{
  // ...
  "result": {
    "kind": "error",
    "http_status_code": 400,
    "error_code": "InvalidRequest",
    "error_message": "project to be deleted contains a vpc: default"
  }
}
```
